# Source data drops — inputs, not source code.
#
# The Weekly Market Pulse Tracker workbook (~10MB) and the daily NSE
# Index_close_*.csv arrive on their own schedule and would bloat git history
# quickly. What gets committed is their OUTPUT: data/index_*.parquet, built by
# parse_index_xlsx.py and kept current by append_daily_close.py.
#
# Keep the latest drop of each here locally; the scripts pick the newest file
# automatically.
*.xlsx
*.csv

# Excel lock files, created while a workbook is open.
~$*
